      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/warrior/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Warrior grew around the main line, becoming Warrior Station, a booming rail hub in its early years.",
